        <mxCell id="c88" value="&lt;i&gt;Block heights follow the word budgets of the model memo, which add up to 570 to 830 words; the guide keeps the model to about 700. Each tag names a requirement whose results the part uses. The appendix has a map and a table and no word budget.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="664" width="860" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
